"""v117 — named programmes behind the field tags of 38 more added records.

Until now the tags of these records came from matching words on their pages.
Each official list of majors was read again on 14 October 2026 (Dillard's on 12 October) and every tag
is now backed by one named undergraduate programme, with the page it was read
on. A tag is taken off where the list shows the field only as a minor, a
concentration of another degree or pre-professional preparation; the reason
is kept as a field note. Nothing is added: a field missing from the tags may
still exist. Graduate, accelerated (4+1), certificate and dual-degree entries
were not used. Admission rules of individual programmes were not checked.

Babson awards a single degree, so its two tags are marked as concentrations
of that degree instead."""
